request.description:
Bagian atas halaman Report Quiz per tab. Query: `type` (wajib: daily_quiz, uji_kom, tryout), `date_from` & `date_to` (tanggal submit WIB, inklusif, maks 366 hari; kosong = rentang default pengaturan s/d hari ini), `education_level_id`, `grade_id`, `subject_id`, `wrong_threshold` (1-100 %, kosong = pengaturan).

`data`:
- `period` {date_from, date_to}
- `cards.sessions` {total, distinct_quizzes (null Daily Quiz), students}
- `cards.average_score` {overall, by_level[{education_level, sessions, average}]}
- `cards.on_time` {percent, on_time, timed_out} (null Daily Quiz: tanpa timer)
- `cards.frequently_wrong` {threshold_percent, count, total_questions, top_chapter {id, name, count}, questions[maks 10]}
- `trend.weeks[12]` {week_start, week_end, sessions, average} + `trend.series[]` per jenjang {education_level, points[]}
- `distribution[5]` {label 0-20 … 81-100, min, max, count, highlighted}
